  "description": "DidiSoft OpenSSL Library for .NET is a managed .NET class library for C# and VB.NET developers. It provides simple cryptography API compatible with the original OpenSSL software (https://openssl.org) but without any external dependencies (this is not a wrapper over OpenSSL but a clean rewrite). With OpenSSL Library for .NET it is easy to exchange encrypted data with Windows/Linux systems that use OpenSSL encryption.\n\t\t\n\t\tThis is a paid commercial product with a free 30-day trial:\n\t\t- Trial mode: Download this package\n\t\t- Licensed mode: Purchase the product at https://www.didisoft.com/purchase/#OpenSSLNet\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\tDocumentation: https://www.didisoft.com/openssl-net/examples/\n\t\t\n\t\tFully supported platforms:\n\t\t- .NET 5, 6, 7, 8, 9\n\t\t- .NET Framework 4.0, 4.5.x, 4.6.x, 4.7.x, 4.8.x\n\t\t- .NET Framework 2.0, 3.0, 3.5, 3.5 SP1\n\t\t- .NET Core 3.1\n\t\t- Xamarin.iOS, Xamarin.Mac, Xamarin.Android\n\t\t- Universal Windows Platform (UWP)",
